功，編於前史之末。奏上之後，退填溝壑，無所復恨。","person_id":"idb_k2n_p9s","related_person_ids":["pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","gxd_15x_9d0","572_278_cba","zb2_16q_up6","52t_0qg_ahc","hqp_o1w_ihy","4qw_13i_jn6","5sl_p6s_iab","57a_8f8_a32","7zm_eif_r34"],"reading":"華覈自敘前後兩次修史：權末丁孚項峻；亮時韋曜、周昭、薛瑩、梁廣及上疏之臣華覈。五人不同於陳壽。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-xueying"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin:line068:reading-000-034","kind":"received_sentence","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin:line068","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":34,"source_quote":"　　永安元年，徵為西陵督，封都亭侯，後轉左虎林。中書丞華覈表薦胤曰：","person_id":"idb_k2n_p9s","related_person_ids":["a7e_y62_4rv"],"reading":"永安元年陸胤西陵督、都亭侯、轉左虎林，華覈表薦。","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-061-luyin","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-061-luyin"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"華覈","kind":"person","person_id":"idb_k2n_p9s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"覈","kind":"person","person_id":"idb_k2n_p9s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete:line120","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhouzhao-complete"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line064:m0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"華覈","kind":"person","person_id":"idb_k2n_p9s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line064","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-061-lukai:line044:m0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"華覈","