:"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":64,"last_line":64,"revision_id":2086397,"raw_start":7913,"raw_end":7986,"character_positions":[7913,7914,7915,7916,7917,7918,7919,7920,7921,7922,7923,7924,7925,7926,7927,7928,7929,7930,7931,7932,7933,7934,7935,7936,7937,7938,7939,7940,7941,7942,7943,7944,7945,7946,7947,7948,7949,7950,7951,7952,7953,7954,7955,7956,7957,7958,7959,7960,7961,7962,7963,7964,7965,7966,7967,7968,7969,7970,7971,7972,7973,7974,7975,7976,7977,7978,7979,7980,7981,7982,7983,7984,7985]},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-053","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-053-xueying"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line066","text":"臣聞五帝三王皆立史官，敘錄功美，垂之無窮。漢時司馬遷、班固，咸命世大才，所撰精妙，與六經俱傳。大吳受命，建國南土。大皇帝末年，命太史令丁孚、郎中項峻始撰《吳書》。孚、峻俱非史才，其所撰作，不足紀錄。至少帝時，更差韋曜、周昭、薛瑩、梁廣及臣五人，訪求往事，所共撰立，備有本末。昭、廣先亡，曜負恩蹈罪，瑩出為將，復以過徙，其書遂委滯，迄今末撰奏。臣愚淺才劣，適可為瑩等記注而已，若使撰合，必襲孚、峻之跡，懼墜大皇帝之元功，損當世之盛美。瑩涉學既博，文章尤妙，同寮之中，瑩為冠首。今者見吏，雖多經學，記述之才，如瑩者少，是以慺慺為國惜之。實欲使卒垂成之功，編於前史之末。奏上之後，退填溝壑，無所復恨。","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line066:m0023","start":23,"end":26,"surface":"司馬遷","kind":"person","person_id":"pme_eis_xqi_*A*AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line066:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"班固","kind":"person","person_id":"gxd_15x_9d0","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line066:m0057","start":57,"end":60,"surface":"大皇帝","kind":"person","person_id":"572_278_cba","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line066:m0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"丁孚","kind":"person","person_id":"zb2_16q_up6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-053-xueying:line066:m0072","start":72,"end":74,"surface":"項峻","kind":"person","